; SniperTurtle_KZ_v1.00  -  TRADE (sample)
; Derived from SniperEA_990555.set: all 139 shared keys carried VERBATIM,
; so the trading behaviour is the one you already run. Overridden:
;   InpMagic      990555 -> 994000            (or it manages SniperEA trades)
;   InpCsvPrefix  SniperEA_Log -> SniperTurtle_Log
;   InpTgPrefix   SniperEA -> SniperTurtle
; New module: killzone ranges RECORDING (InpKzrFilter=false) - it prints and
; alerts, blocks nothing. Entries still carry KZR= in the CSV either way.
; Telegram is left OFF here - fill InpTgToken / InpTgChatId on the machine.
;
; LOT SIZE, read this before assuming: InpUseSessionLots=true is carried from
; the base and WINS over InpRiskPercent. So this trades a flat 0.05 lot, and
; InpRiskPercent=0.5 does nothing at all. That is what 990555 actually does -
; carried on purpose, not an oversight. To size by risk instead, set
;   InpUseSessionLots=false  AND  InpUseFixedLot=false
; and only then does the 0.5% apply.
